 "body_html": "<h2>Cómo se hace</h2><p>El <b>límite</b> de f en a es el valor al que se acerca f(x) cuando x se acerca a a. Si los límites laterales no coinciden, no existe.</p><p>Cuando x → +∞, en un cociente de polinomios mandan los términos de mayor grado.</p><p><b>Indeterminaciones</b>: 0/0 (se factoriza y simplifica), ∞/∞ (se comparan grados).</p><p>f es <b>continua</b> en a si f(a) existe, el límite existe y los dos coinciden. Una tarifa continua no tiene «saltos».</p><div class='qfig'><svg data-pf='lg' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 330 240' width='330' height='240' role='img' aria-label='coste medio: se acerca a 5 € cuando x crece'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><line x1='34.0' y1='212.0' x2='34.0' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='86.4' y1='212.0' x2='86.4' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='86.4' y='232.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>200</text><line x1='138.8' y1='212.0' x2='138.8' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='138.8' y='232.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>400</text><line x1='191.2' y1='212.0' x2='191.2' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='191.2' y='232.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>600</text><line x1='243.6' y1='212.0' x2='243.6' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='243.6' y='232.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>800</text><line x1='296.0' y1='212.0' x2='296.0' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='296.0' y='232.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>1000</text><line x1='34.0' y1='212.0' x2='296.0' y2='212.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='190.5' x2='296.0' y2='190.5' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='26.0' y='195.5' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='end'>5</te